  "title": "Pachacuti Inca Yupanqui",
  "summary": "Pachacuti was the ninth Inca ruler. Tradition dates his rise to AD 1438, after the defeat of the Chanca. He is credited with redesigning and rebuilding Cusco and with the early expansion of the state that became Tawantinsuyu. His reign is given as 1438–1471.",
